## Error Handling

### HTTP Response codes

API uses the standard HTTP response codes for HTTP requests.

| Response Status Code | Description                                                                                                                                                 |
|----------------------|----------------------------|
| 200                  | OK                         |
| 201                  | Created                    |
| 400                  | Bad Request                |
| 401                  | Unauthorized               |
| 403                  | Forbidden                  |
| 404                  | Not Found                  |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      ||
| 405                  | Method not allowed         |
| 415                  | Unsupported media type     |
| 422                  | Unprocessable Entity       |
| 500                  | Internal server error      |
| 503                  | Service unavailable        |

### General errors

The standard response body for general server errors is:

```
{
  "httpStatus": 500,
  "code": "GENERAL_HTTP_ERROR",
  "codeDescription": "Error is not probably caused by business logic but by general HTTP 500 (Internal Server Error), etc...",
  "details": "Description of the problem"
}
```


## Authentication

Bearer (token) authentication is used on all endpoints. You will receive your token from our representant.

Invalid authentication response body:

```
{
    "timestamp": "2022-02-01T13:06:10.505+00:00",
    "path": "/v1/orders",
    "status": 401,
    "error": "Unauthorized",
    "message": "Authentication was not done or is invalid.",
    "requestId": "119e2bfa-1"
}
```
## General rules
+ If any attribute is null, this attribute is not included in the response.

## Group Products

## Product Summary [/v1/products/summary{?source}]

### Get Product Summary [GET]

Used to get brief product summary listed in MPI.

+ Parameters
    + source: `MALL.CZ` (string, optional) - eshop, if not specified, every eshop is taken into consideration, support multiple eshop filters, each query parameter should be defined separately

+ Request
    + Headers
    
                Authorization: Bearer SIsImlhdCI6MTUxNjIzOTAyMn0
    
+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Attributes (array[ProductSummary])

## Product Availability, Prices & Handling Time [/v1/products/availability]

### Update Product Availability, Prices & Handling Time [PUT]

Use to update on hand quantity, price, minimum price, vat, B2B price, B2B price vat, B2B price currency & handling time.
+ Price and minimum price need to be updated individually for each sales channel.
+ B2B Price need to be updated globally at the product level.
+ When updating on hand, you can use globalOnHand, onHand for individual salesChannels or combination.
    + GlobalOnHand will update stock in all your sales channels to same value.
    + onHand in salesChannels object can be used to send different values to each sales channel.
    + When used in combination, value from within salesChannels object will be used for individual sales channels and value form globalOnHand will be used for all remaining sales channels, which were not updated inidividually.


If there are any products in the request that are invalid or an error occurred during the update, the response code will be 200, however there will be additional fields present such as "hasError" and "errors" detailing the mistakes.
Possible errors:

```"Product with ID {} is defined multiple times ({})."```
```"Cannot set VAT {} to item {} at channel {}. Must be one of {}."```
```"Product with ID {} does not exist."```

In case of any missing productIDs in the request, the response follows this format:

```
{
  "httpStatus": 400,
  "code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
  "codeDescription": "Validation of request failed",
  "details": "productId cannot be null."
}
```
    

+ Request Global onhand update example (application/json)
    + Headers
                
                Authorization: Bearer SIsImlhdCI6MTUxNjIzOTAyMn0
                
    + Attributes (ProductAvailabilityRequest)
    
    + Body
    
                {
                  "products": [
                    {
                      "productId": "A25253FG",
                      "globalOnHand": 45,
                            "b2bPrice": {
                                "value": 20,
                                "vat": 23,
                                "currency": "EUR"
                        },
                      "salesChannels": [
                        {
                          "salesChannelCode": "MALLCZ",
                          "price": 700,
                          "vat": 21,
                          "handlingTime": 2,
                          "minimumPrice": 500
                        },
                         {
                          "salesChannelCode": "MALLSK",
                          "price": 35,
                          "vat": 22,
                          "handlingTime": 4,
                          "minimumPrice": 25
                        },
                        {
                          "salesChannelCode": "ALZACZ",
                          "price": 560,
                          "vat": 21
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "productId": "B2578D",
                      "globalOnHand": 5,
                      "globalHandlingTime": 0
                    }
                  ]
                }

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Attributes
    
+ Request Onhand update for sales channels example (application/json)
    + Headers
                
                Authorization: Bearer SIsImlhdCI6MTUxNjIzOTAyMn0
                
    + Attributes (ProductAvailabilityRequest)
    
    + Body
    
                {
                  "hasErrors": true,
                  "errors": [
                    {
                      "productId": "B2578D",
                      "errorMessage": "Product with ID B2578D does not exist."
                    }
                  ],
                  "products": [
                    {
                      "productId": "A25253FG",
                      "globalOnHand": null,
                      "salesChannels": [
                        {
                          "salesChannelCode": "MALLCZ",
                          "onHand": 45,
                          "price": 700,
                          "vat": 21
                        },
                         {
