## Product Detailed Summary [/v1/products/detailed-summary{?extraFields}]

### Get Product Detailed Summary [POST]

Returns paginated detailed product summary from MPI, including per-sales-channel availability, price, currency and handling time.

+ This endpoint uses **POST** because filtering is provided in request body.
+ If query parameter `extraFields=offerData` is used, additional `offerData` object is returned for each sales channel (if available).
+ If `filter` is empty (`{}`), all products are returned (paginated).
+ If any attribute is null, this attribute is not included in the response (see *General rules*).
+ Maximum supported value for `pageSize` is `100`.
+ `offerData` may be returned with partial fields only (e.g. missing `offerId`) depending on current offer lifecycle state.

+ Parameters
    + extraFields: `offerData` (string, optional) - Additional response fields. Currently supported value: `offerData`.

+ Request Filter by sales channels and product IDs (application/json)
    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer token

    + Body

            {
              "page": 1,
              "pageSize": 100,
              "filter": {
                "saleChannelCodes": ["ALZA.CZ", "ALLEGRO.CZ"],
                "productIds": ["5901234123457", "X100-LAMP"]
              }
            }

+ Request Filter by sales channels only (application/json)
    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer token

    + Body

            {
              "page": 1,
              "pageSize": 100,
              "filter": {
                "saleChannelCodes": ["ALZA.CZ", "ALLEGRO.CZ"]
              }
            }

+ Request All products (application/json)
    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer token

    + Body

            {
              "page": 1,
              "pageSize": 100,
              "filter": {}
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Body

            {
              "total": 3,
              "page": 1,
              "pageSize": 100,
              "data": [
                {
                  "productId": "5901234123457",
                  "ean": "5901234123457",
                  "globalOnHand": 12,
                  "salesChannels": [
                    {
                      "salesChannelCode": "ALZA.CZ",
                      "onHand": 10,
                      "price": 2499.00,
                      "currency": "CZK",
                      "handlingTime": 2,
                      "offerData": {
                        "offerId": "A-100245",
                        "title": "Ergo Office Chair Mesh Black",
                        "status": "PUBLISHED_LIVE"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "salesChannelCode": "ALLEGRO.CZ",
                      "onHand": 2,
                      "price": 2599.00,
                      "currency": "CZK",
                      "handlingTime": 3,
                      "offerData": {
                        "offerId": "CZ-77881234",
                        "title": "Ergo Office Chair Mesh Black",
                        "status": "UPDATE_PENDING"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "productId": "4006381333931",
                  "ean": "4006381333931",
                  "globalOnHand": 0,
                  "salesChannels": [
                    {
                      "salesChannelCode": "ALZA.CZ",
                      "onHand": 0,
                      "price": 899.00,
                      "forcePrice": 849.00,
                      "currency": "CZK",
                      "handlingTime": 7,
                      "offerData": {
                        "offerId": "A-100246",
                        "title": "Desk Lamp LED Warm White",
                        "status": "MPI_ONLY"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "productId": "X100-LAMP",
                  "ean": "8712345678906",
                  "globalOnHand": 5,
                  "salesChannels": [
                    {
                      "salesChannelCode": "ALLEGRO.CZ",
                      "onHand": 5,
