              "error": "Unauthorized",
              "message": "Authentication was not done or is invalid.",
              "requestId": "119e2bfa-1"
            }


## Group Order Management

## Order status flow logic
Changes in order status are defined as follows
- RESERVATION (set by Marketplace) – change possible to CANCEL or OPEN
- OPEN (set by Marketplace) – change possible to CANCEL or SHIPPING
- SHIPPING (set by Partner) – change possible to CANCEL or SHIPPED. SHIPPING is not recognized state for every marketplace, but it is to be set in MPI in all cases.
- SHIPPED (set by Partner)  – change possible to DELIVERED or RETURNED
- DELIVERED (set by Partner, Mall, Kaufland) - final status -> order in DELIVERED status cannot be changed to any other status.
- RETURNED (final status valid for all marketplaces) => order was returned from carrier, before it was delivered to customer.

![Order flow diagram](https://codingbear-public-assets.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/order_flow_diagram_v2.jpg)

## Carriers
Carrier that will be used for goods delivery is defined for every order by carrier identification. For this purpose ENUM is defined listing all supported carriers. In case of MALL delivery platform (https://knowledgebase.mallgroup.com/category/dopravy/mall-doprava/) or ALZA transport, only certain carriers are used
- MDP Classic
    - ULOZENKA, DPD
- MDP Spectrum
    - DPD
- ALZA Transport
    - TOPTRANS, DPD, PACKETA, ALZA

## Serial numbers
<a name="serial-numbers"></a>

Some ALZA orders may need serial numbers to be successfully processed by marketplace. For this functionality was added information
about required serial numbers to those endpoints [Get orders](#get-orders), [Get order](#get-order). 

Be sure all serial numbers are filled when updating order to status **SHIPPED**.

## Get Orders [/v1/orders{?status,from,to,partnerId,originalId,source,extraFields}]
<a name="get-orders"></a>

+ Parameters
    + status (String, optional)
        You can select multiple statuses. You can also leave blank to get orders in any status.
        + values
            + `RESERVATION`
            + `OPEN`
            + `SHIPPING`
            + `SHIPPED`
            + `DELIVERED`
            + `RETURNED`
            + `CANCELLED`
    + from: `2025-08-10` (string, optional) - From date (ISO 8601 YYYY-MM-DD format) *If this property and orders ids are not specified, only orders created within last 30 days will be returned.*
    + to: `2025-09-10` (string, optional) - To date (ISO 8601 YYYY-MM-DD format) - If not specified, all orders created beginning "from" till current date will be returned.
    + partnerId: 52165815 (string, optional) - You can select multiple ids of the orders as referenced in your system
    + originalId: 10034238001 (string, optional) - You can select multiple ids of the orders as referenced in origin system. Should be used with source parameter as original Id does not have to be unique in MPI system.
    + source (String, optional)
        You can select multiple sources. The source represents the system order was created in.
        + values
             + `MALL.HR`
             + `MIMOVRSTE.COM`
             + `ALZA.CZ`
             + `KAUFLAND.CZ`
             + `KAUFLAND.SK`
             + `KAUFLAND.DE`
             + `KAUFLAND.AT`
             + `KAUFLAND.FR`
             + `KAUFLAND.IT`
             + `ALLEGRO.PL`
             + `ALLEGRO.CZ`
             + `ALLEGRO.SK`
             + `ALLEGRO.HU`
             + `HEUREKA.CZ`
             + `HEUREKA.SK`
             + `HEUREKA.HU`
    + extraFields (String, optional)
        Currently you can select an extra field for billingAddress and carrier.note.
        + values
             + `billingAddress`
             + `lastMileDeliveryAddress`
             + `carrier.note`
             + `paymentId`
             + `packages`

