## Upload Order Document [/v1/orders/documents/upload]

### Upload order document [POST]

Use to upload an invoice or credit note for an order. The document is stored in MPI and then sent to the marketplace.

The endpoint accepts `multipart/form-data`:
+ file is sent in field `attachment`
+ JSON payload is sent in field `uploadDocumentRequest`

Identification rules:
+ At least one of `orderId` or `originalId` must be provided
+ If both `orderId` and `originalId` are provided, both values must match the same order
+ `orderId` means partner order id
+ `originalId` means marketplace order id
+ For B2B orders, `originalId` is MPI internal order id

Supported document types:
+ `invoice`
+ `credit-note`

+ Request Example request (multipart/form-data)
    + Headers

            Authorization: Bearer SIsImlhdCI6MTUxNjIzOTAyMn0

    + Body

            --boundary
            Content-Disposition: form-data; name="attachment"; filename="invoice.pdf"
            Content-Type: application/pdf
            
            <binary data>
            
            --boundary
            Content-Disposition: form-data; name="uploadDocumentRequest"
            Content-Type: application/json
            
            {
                "orderId": "Partner123",
                "originalId": "ae5d4eb4-c7e9-4b7a-a633-d411dc8b83eb",
                "documentId": "INV_20251013123",
                "documentType": "invoice"
            }
            --boundary--

+ Response 200 (application/json)

+ Response 400 (application/json)
    + Body

            {
                "httpStatus": 400,
                "code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
                "codeDescription": "Validation of request failed",
                "details": "INVOICE is generated automatically."
            }


+ Response 404 (application/json)
    + Body

            {
                "httpStatus": 404,
                "code": "NOT_FOUND",
                "codeDescription": "The specified resource or entity has not been found",
                "details": "Order with Partner ID: (7fb1caa0-5b1c-11f0-8be7-f3ad67ce70f2) or Original ID: (null) for partner (TEST01) not found."
            }

