# Data Structures

## CrossDockTracking
 - parcelTrackingNumber: 123abc45897 (string, required) - parcel tracking identificator 
 - parcelTrackingUrl: 'www.parceltracking.com/id=abc' (string, required) - parcel tracking url 

## CrossDock
 - parcelTracking (array[CrossDockTracking]) - array of parcel tracking records

## ProductSummary(object)
 + source (Source) - the eshop the products are listed for
 + products: `01`, `02`, `V01` (array[string]) - the listed products


## ProductDetailedSummaryRequest (object)
 + page: 1 (number, required) - Page number (1-based).
 + pageSize: 100 (number, required) - Number of products per page. Maximum value is `100`.
 + filter (ProductDetailedSummaryFilter, optional) - Filtering criteria. Can be an empty object `{}`.

## ProductDetailedSummaryFilter (object)
 + saleChannelCodes: `ALZA.CZ`, `ALLEGRO.CZ` (array[string], optional) - Filter by sales channel codes.
 + productIds: `5901234123457`, `X100-LAMP` (array[string], optional) - Filter by product IDs.

## ProductDetailedSummaryResponse (object)
 + total: 3 (number) - Total number of matching products (across all pages).
 + page: 1 (number) - Current page number.
 + pageSize: 100 (number) - Number of items requested per page.
 + data (array[ProductDetailedSummaryItem]) - Result items for current page.

## ProductDetailedSummaryItem (object)
 + productId: `5901234123457` (string) - Product identifier in partner/MPI scope.
 + ean: `5901234123457` (string, optional) - EAN/GTIN of the product (typically 13 digits for EAN-13).
 + globalOnHand: 12 (number, optional) - Global on hand quantity for the product.
 + salesChannels (array[ProductDetailedSummarySalesChannel]) - Per-sales-channel summary.

## ProductDetailedSummarySalesChannel (object)
 + salesChannelCode: `ALZA.CZ` (string) - Sales channel code.
 + onHand: 10 (number, optional) - On hand quantity for this sales channel.
 + price: 2499.00 (number, optional) - Customer price including VAT in sales channel currency.
 + forcePrice: 849.00 (number, optional) - Forced price (if configured for the sales channel/product).
 + currency: `CZK` (string, optional) - Currency code (ISO 4217).
 + handlingTime: 2 (number, optional) - Handling time in days.
 + offerData (ProductDetailedSummaryOfferData, optional) - Returned only when `extraFields=offerData` is specified.

## ProductDetailedSummaryOfferData (object)
 + offerId: `A-100245` (string, optional) - Marketplace/MPI offer identifier.
 + title: `Ergo Office Chair Mesh Black` (string, optional) - Offer title. May be empty string.
 + status (ProductDetailedSummaryOfferStatus, optional) - Offer status.

## ProductDetailedSummaryOfferStatus (enum)
 + `ACTIVATION_FAILED`
 + `DELETION_FAILED`
 + `DRAFT`
 + `IMPORT_FAILED`
 + `INTERNAL_ERROR`
 + `MPI_ONLY`
 + `PUBLISHED_LIVE`
 + `PUBLISHED_TEST`
 + `TO_BE_ACTIVATED_PROCESSING`
 + `TO_BE_DELETED`
 + `TO_BE_PUBLISHED`
 + `UPDATE_FAILED`
 + `UPDATE_PENDING`

## OrderSimpleError(object)
 + originalId: `10034238001` (string) - Id of the order as referenced in origin system.
 + validationError: `Change to status CANCELLED is not allowed from status SHIPPED at original ID 324GHdf87.` (string) - any error encountered during the batch-update

## OrderDetail (object)
 + id: `52165815` (string) - Id of the order as referenced in your system (will not be present during first response).
 + originalId: `10034238001` (string) - Id of the order as referenced in origin system.
 + source (Source) - The system order was created in.
 + status (OrderStatus) - Representation of actual order status.
 + currency: `CZK` (string) - 3 character currency code as defined in ISO 4217. Valid for all prices in the order
 + deliveryPrice: 119 (number) - The price customer was charged for delivery.
 + paymentPrice: 39 (number) - The price customer was charged for selected payment method.
 + cashOnDelivery: true (boolean) - If true, the order will be paied upon delivery.
 + cashOnDeliveryValue: 518 (number) - The amount to be paid upon delivery.
 + requestDeliveryDate: `2025-09-12` (string, optional) - The delivery date, customer has specified as requested delivery date (ISO 2014 YYYY-MM-DD)
 + requestExpeditionDate: `2025-09-12` (string, optional) - The expedition date, eshop has specified as requested expedition date (ISO 2014 YYYY-MM-DD)
 + suggestedExpeditionDate: `2025-09-11` (string, optional) - The suggested date so that ordered products arrive on schedule.  (ISO 2014 YYYY-MM-DD)
 + suggestedExpeditionTimestamp: `2025-09-11T02:00:00+02:00` (string, optional) - The suggested date with time so that ordered products arrive on schedule. (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + actualDeliveryDate: `2025-09-12T08:20:52+02:00` (string) - Date and time when actual delivery to the customer happened   (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + items (array[Item])
 + carrier (Carrier)
 + shippingLabelsPrintMethod(ShippingLabelMethod) - Determines the way, Generate Shipping Labels method is used. Only present, if 'managedByPartner' flag in carrier is set to 'false'
 + deliveryAddress (DeliveryAddress)
 + dateCreated: `2025-09-11T13:01:34+02:00` (string) - The date and time the order was created in origin system  (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + dateConfirmed: `2025-09-11T13:01:54+02:00` (string) - The date and time the order was first updated to shipping status (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + dateProcessing: `2025-09-11T16:31:23+02:00` (string) - The date and time the order was changed to status shipping (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + dateShipped: `2025-09-11T16:31:23+02:00` (string) - The date and time the order was changed to status shipped (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + dateDelivered: `2025-09-12T09:54:47+02:00` (string) - The date and time the order was changed to status delivered (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + dateReturned: `2025-09-13T06:44:32+02:00` (string) - The date and time the order was changed to status returned (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + dateCancelled: `2025-09-14T10:19:14+02:00` (string) - The date and time the order was changed to status cancelled (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + cancelReason (CancelReason): 
 + errorMessage: `Parsin error - dateConfirmed is not in valid format` - (string) - Error message from eshop API if any error occurs
 + updateStatus (UpdateStatus) - Representation of actual order update status in the target sales channel system.
 + orderDeliveryType (OrderDeliveryType) - Order delivery type 
 + readyToReturn: false (boolean) - if true, order is ready to to be returned to you. This information may be passed to you by some sales channels to inform you, the order will be returned. 
 + invoiceRequired: false (boolean) - if true, partner must take care of order invoicing.
 + paymentId: `17f2cf0f-9e0c-11f0-82f0-99c3851aae49` (string) - The payment id from marketplace.
 + shippingListUrl: `https://www.url.com/shippingListExample/6541651d1s616s1vds6` (string)
 + serialNumbers (optional, array[SerialNumber])
 + lastMileDeliveryAddress (DeliveryAddress)
 + billingAddress (BillingAddress)
 + packages(array[OrderPackage])
 
## OrderDetailV2 (object)
 + id: `52165815` (string) - Id of the order as referenced in your system (will not be present during first response).
 + originalId: `10034238001` (string) - Id of the order as referenced in origin system.
 + source (Source) - The system order was created in.
 + status (OrderStatus) - Representation of actual order status.
 + currency: `CZK` (string) - 3 character currency code as defined in ISO 4217. Valid for all prices in the order
 + deliveryPrice: 119 (number) - The price customer was charged for delivery.
 + paymentPrice: 39 (number) - The price customer was charged for selected payment method.
 + cashOnDelivery: true (boolean) - If true, the order will be paied upon delivery.
 + cashOnDeliveryValue: 518 (number) - The amount to be paid upon delivery.
 + requestDeliveryDate: `2025-09-12` (string, optional) - The delivery date, customer has specified as requested delivery date (ISO 2014 YYYY-MM-DD)
 + requestExpeditionDate: `2025-09-12` (string, optional) - The expedition date, eshop has specified as requested expedition date (ISO 2014 YYYY-MM-DD)
 + suggestedExpeditionDate: `2025-09-11` (string, optional) - The suggested date so that ordered products arrive on schedule.  (ISO 2014 YYYY-MM-DD)
 + suggestedExpeditionTimestamp: `2025-09-11T02:00:00+02:00` (string, optional) - The suggested date with time so that ordered products arrive on schedule. (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + actualDeliveryDate: `2025-09-12T08:20:52+02:00` (string) - Date and time when actual delivery to the customer happened   (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + items (array[ItemV2])
 + carrier (Carrier)
 + shippingLabelsPrintMethod(ShippingLabelMethod) - Determines the way, Generate Shipping Labels method is used. Only present, if 'managedByPartner' flag in carrier is set to 'false'
 + deliveryAddress (DeliveryAddress)
 + dateCreated: `2025-09-11T13:01:34+02:00` (string) - The date and time the order was created in origin system  (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + dateConfirmed: `2025-09-11T13:01:54+02:00` (string) - The date and time the order was first updated to shipping status (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + dateProcessing: `2025-09-11T16:31:23+02:00` (string) - The date and time the order was changed to status shipping (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + dateShipped: `2025-09-11T16:31:23+02:00` (string) - The date and time the order was changed to status shipped (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + dateDelivered: `2025-09-12T09:54:47+02:00` (string) - The date and time the order was changed to status delivered (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + dateReturned: `2025-09-13T06:44:32+02:00` (string) - The date and time the order was changed to status returned (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + dateCancelled: `2025-09-14T10:19:14+02:00` (string) - The date and time the order was changed to status cancelled (ISO 8601 formatyyyy-MM-dd'T'hh:mm:ss[+|-]hh:mm)
 + cancelReason (CancelReason): 
 + errorMessage: `Parsin error - dateConfirmed is not in valid format` - (string) - Error message from eshop API if any error occurs
 + updateStatus (UpdateStatus) - Representation of actual order update status in the target sales channel system.
 + orderDeliveryType (OrderDeliveryType) - Order delivery type 
 + readyToReturn: false (boolean) - if true, order is ready to to be returned to you. This information may be passed to you by some sales channels to inform you, the order will be returned. 
 + invoiceRequired: false (boolean) - if true, partner must take care of order invoicing.
 + paymentId: `17f2cf0f-9e0c-11f0-82f0-99c3851aae49` (string) - The payment id from marketplace.
 + shippingListUrl: `https://www.url.com/shippingListExample/6541651d1s616s1vds6` (string)
