## OrderPackage (object)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
+ packageNumber: `PKG-001` (string) - Short package number, extracted from *packageFullNumber* by the rules of the assigned carrier, or provided directly by the e-shop.                                                                                                                                         
+ packageFullNumber: `PKG-FULL-001` (string) - Full package number, i.e. the complete carrier barcode (waybill number) returned by the carrier or the marketplace.   

## SerialNumber (object)
 + id: `1` (number) - If you provide *id*, you must also provide *orderLineId*.
 + orderLineId: `98312` (number) - If you provide *orderLineId*, you must also provide *id*.
 + itemId: `A25253FG` (string) - The id of the item from the items list.
 + serialNumber: `PRT3020610485` (string)

## OrderList (object)
 + hasErrors: true (boolean) - True if there was any error during update found
 + errors (array[OrderSimpleError])
 + orders (array[OrderDetail])

## OrderListV2 (object)
 + hasErrors: true (boolean) - True if there was any error during update found
 + errors (array[OrderSimpleError])
 + orders (array[OrderDetailV2])

## Carrier (object)
 + managedByPartner: false (boolean) - True if you are responsible for carrier arrangements. False if carrier is managed by the sales channel.
 + originalId: `125` (string) - Carrier reference in origin system.
 + identification (Identification): `ULOZENKA` - Unified identification of carrier in MPI system
 + type (DeliveryType) - Parcelshop or home delivery.
 + parcelShop (ParcelShop)
 + parcelTrackingNumber: `18978009` (number) - Parcel number in the tracking system of the carrier.
 + parcelTrackingUrl: `https://tracking.com/status/cs_CZ/parcel/06505038808622` (string) - Link to parcel in parcel tracking system of carrier.
 + note: `Linehaul` (string) - Individualized additional information obtained from a specific marketplace. For alza orders used to divide "R", "L", "Z" orders.

## CarrierUpdate (object)
 + parcelTrackingNumber: `18978009` (number) - Parcel number in the tracking system of the carrier.
 + parcelTrackingUrl: `https://tracking.com/status/cs_CZ/parcel/06505038808622` (string) - Link to parcel in parcel tracking system of carrier.

