## SalesChannelProductAvailability (object)
 + salesChannelCode (SalesChannelCode) - Eshop code the price and availability are related to.
 + onHand: 24 (number, optional) - Quantity of the product available for this sales channel. If used together with globalOnHand, seles channel specific value will be preferred.
 + price: 560 (number, optional) - Customer price for the product in the currency of sales channel including VAT. Must be > 0.
 + rrp: 700 (number, optional) - Recommended retail price. Common price for the product including VAT. Used by some sales channels to be compared with actual price and presented to customer as discount.
 + vat: 21 (number, optional) - VAT tax rate for the product in percents. If not sent, vat of the product will remain unchanged
 + handlingTime: 1 (number, optional) - how many days is required for product to be prepared for handover to last mile delivery carrier
 + minimumPrice: 500 (number, optional) - Minimum product price which can be used for offer marketplace bidding (Currently working only for Kaufland)
    
## Item (object)
 + id: `A25253FG` (string) - Product id from your system.
 + originalId: `100001540106` (string) - Product id as listed in origin system.
 + count: 3 (number) - Number of ordered products
 + unitPrice: 200 (number) - Price of unit sold in order currency including VAT. This is a unit price from original order and might represent different price based on marketplace.
 + customerUnitPrice: 200 (number) - Price for which the product was supposed to be sold to end customer including VAT. It represent price that was synced to marketplace before purchase. It may vary against real unit sell price because marketplaces may apply discounts or increase the final price in some cases.
 + unitPriceWithoutCommission: 170 (number) -  Price of the unit without marketplace commission including VAT. This price (minus VAT) should be invoiced from marketplace to partner.
 + vat: 21 (number) - VAT tax of the product.
 + commission: 15 (number) - item commission in percent. Received for MALL orders, calculated for ALZA orders
 
## ItemV2 (object)
 + id: `A25253FG` (string) - Product id from your system.
 + originalId: `100001540106` (string) - Product id as listed in origin system.
 + ean: `8594001234567` (string) - Product EAN as listed in origin system.
 + barCodes (array[string]) - Bar codes assigned to the item by the marketplace.
 + count: 3 (number) - Number of ordered products
 + sellerUnitPrice: `200` (number) - Price per unit the marketplace sold the item for. It is the base for the commission — the unit commission equals *sellerUnitPrice* minus *payoutUnitPrice*.                                                                                                                  
 + customerUnitPrice: `150` (number) - Price per unit actually paid by the end customer, as reported by the marketplace.                                                                                                                                                                                          
 + invoiceUnitPrice: `150` (number) - Price per unit used on the invoice for the item, i.e. the seller price reduced by the marketplace commission.                                                                                                                                                               
 + payoutUnitPrice: `185` (number) - Price per unit the marketplace pays out to the seller.    
 + vat: 21 (number) - VAT tax of the product.
 + commission: 15 (number) - item commission in percent. Received for MALL orders, calculated for ALZA orders

## PackageDetail (object)
 + packageId: 1 (number, required) - package identifier for this request. Needs to be unique within single request
 + One of
    + properties
        + weight: 4300 (number, required) - The weight of the package in grams.
        + dimension1: 12 (number, optional) - First dimension of the package in cm.
        + dimension2: 6 (number, optional) - Second dimension of the package in cm.
        + dimension3: 8 (number, optional) - Third dimension of the package in cm.
    + properties
        + weight: 4300 (number, required) - The weight of the package in grams.
        + volume: 576 (number, optional) - Volume of the package in cm3.

## ParcelShop (object)
 + identification (Identification): `ULOZENKA` - Identification of the parcel shop operator
 + id: `86433` (string) - Id of the branch in the carriers system

## ProductAvailability (object)
 + productId: `A25253FG` (string, required) - Product id from your system.
 + globalOnHand: 45 (number, nullable) - Stock of the product available for all the sales channels managed thru MPI. If used together with sales channel specific onHand, it will be applied to those saleschannels for which the onhand was not specified in this request.
 + globalHandlingTime: 2 (number) - How many days is required for product to be prepared for handover to last mile delivery carrier for all the sales channels managed thru MPI. If used together with sales channel specific handlingTime, it will be applied to those sales channels for which the handlingTime was not specified in this request.
 + b2bPrice (object, optional)
     + value: 20 (number, optional) - Amount excluding VAT for the product’s B2B price, in the original currency.
     + vat: 23 (number, optional) - Orignal VAT rate for the product’s B2B price.
     + currency: `EUR` (string, optional) - Original currency for the product’s B2B price (ISO 4217).
 + salesChannels (array[SalesChannelProductAvailability])

## ProductAvailabilityRequest (object)
 + products (array[ProductAvailability])

## RequestShippingLabels (object)
 + One of
    + properties
        + numberOfPackages: 4 (number, required) - The number of packages, the order will be shipped in. Corresponds to number of labels, that will be printed.
    + properties
        + packages(required)
            + properties
                 + packageId: 1 (number, required) - package identifier for this request. Needs to be unique within single request
                 + One of
                    + properties
                        + weight: 4300 (number, required) - The weight of the package in grams.
                        + dimension1: 12 (number, required) - First dimension of the package in cm.
                        + dimension2: 6 (number, required) - Second dimension of the package in cm.
                        + dimension3: 8 (number, required) - Third dimension of the package in cm.
                        + items (required)
                            + id: `A25253FG` (string, required) - Product id from your system.
                            + count: 3 (number, required) - Count of this product id in the package.
                    + properties
                        + weight: 4300 (number, required) - The weight of the package in grams.
                        + volume: 576 (number, required) - Volume of the package in cm3.
                        + items (required)
                            + id: `A25253FG` (string,required) - Product id from your system.
                            + count: 3 (number, required) - Count of this product id in the package.
                    + properties
                        + size: `SM` (enum[string], required) - Simplified identification of package size.
                            + members
                                 + `XS` - weight up to 2kg, dimensions up to 20x30x20 cm
                                 + `S` - weight  up to 5kg, dimensions up to 40x30x30 cm
                                 + `SM` - weight  up to 10kg, dimensions up to 60x40x30 cm
                                 + `M` - weight  up to 15kg, dimensions up to 70x40x40 cm
                                 + `ML` - weight  up to 20kg, dimensions up to 80x40x50 cm
                                 + `L`- weight  up to 31kg, dimensions up to 90x40x50 cm
                                 + `XL` - weight  up to 50kg, dimensions up to 120x80x90 cm
                                 + `XXL` - weight  up to 200kg, dimensions up to 120x160x120 cm
                        + items (required)
                            + id: `A25253FG` (string, required) - Product id from your system.
                            + count: 3 (number, required) - Count of this product id in the package.                                

## RequestShippingLabelItem (object)
 + id: `A25253FG` (string) - Product id from your system.
 + count: 3 (number) - Count of this product id in the package.

