## OrderStatus (enum)
 + `RESERVATION` (string) - Order created by customer, yet to be paid for or confirmed in case of CoD (cash on delivery).
 + `OPEN` - Order is paid for or confirmed and can be processed by partner.
 + `SHIPPING` - Status used as a conformation, partner has received the order and started order processing.
 + `SHIPPED` - Order ready for dispatch, ready for courier collection. It triggers information that it will be delivered in following days. Final status for Alza orders that allows to invoice order to Alza.
 + `DELIVERED` - Order delivered to customer or collected on pick up point. Used only in case of MALL Marketplace. Final status for Mall orders that allows to invoice order to Mall.
 + `CANCELLED` - Order storno – possible to change by both customer or Partner.
 + `RETURNED` - Order not delivered to customer, not picked up on pick up point. This status is set after the order is returned to partner. Final status for both Alza & Mall. In case of Alza it triggers credit note for order in this status.

## CancelReason (enum)
 + `OUT_OF_STOCK` - use this when you run out of stock.
 + `DAMAGED_GOODS` - use this when goods are damaged.
 + `WRONG_PRICE` - use when it was buyed for incorrect price.
 + `EXTERNAL_SUPPLIER_FAILURE` - use this when there is a problem with external suplier.
 + `MARKETPLACE_REQUEST` - use this when marketplace requests cancellation.
 + `OTHER` - for any other reason not specified with previous values.

