 + `B2C`
 + `B2B`
 + `Branch`
 + `ParcelShop`

## UpdateStatus (enum)
 + `UPDATE_PENDING`
 + `UP_TO_DATE`

## ShippingLabelMethod (enum)
 + `SIMPLE`
 + `DETAILED`

